---
import InfoPage from '../layouts/InfoPage.astro';
import { tools } from '../data/tools.js';
---

<InfoPage
  title="About winisland – Free Party Games and Giveaway Tools | winisland"
  description="winisland.in is a free set of party and giveaway tools: spin the wheel, tambola caller and tickets, winner picker, team divider, Secret Santa, coin toss and dice. No sign-up."
  kicker="About us"
  heading="About winisland"
  intro="A small island of free party tools, built so the fun starts in one tap: no app to install, no account, no fuss."
>
  <section class="panel">
    <h2>Why we made it</h2>
    <p>
      Every party, classroom game and online giveaway hits the same moment: someone has to pick a name, call a number
      or split the teams, and everyone wants it to be fair. Most tools for that are cluttered, ask you to sign up, or want
      access to your social accounts.
    </p>
    <p>
      winisland is our answer. Each tool opens instantly on a phone or laptop, does one job well, and
      shows <strong>"Picked on winisland.in"</strong> on the result so everyone can see where it came from.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="panel">
    <h2>What's on the island</h2>
    <ul>
      {
        tools.map((tool) => (
          <li>
            <a href={tool.href}>{tool.name}</a>: {tool.blurb}
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="panel">
    <h2>How we keep it fair and private</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Fair picks.</strong> Wheels, draws, team splits, coins and dice use your browser's built-in cryptographic
        random number generator, so every name and number has an equal chance.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Your lists stay with you.</strong> Everything runs in your browser. The names you type are saved only on
        your own device, and we have no database to store them in.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>No login, ever.</strong> The giveaway picker works from a pasted list, so you never hand over your
        Instagram or YouTube password.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Works offline.</strong> Once you've opened the site, the tools keep working without internet, which helps
        at parties with patchy Wi-Fi.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="panel">
    <h2>Free, and kept that way by ads</h2>
    <p>
      All the tools are free to use. To pay for hosting and new tools, some pages may show ads beside or below the tool.
      Ads never cover the game area. You can read how ads use data in our <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      winisland is for fun and fair choices only. It is not a betting or gambling site, and our tools must not be used
      for real-money games.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="panel">
    <h2>Say hello</h2>
    <p>
      Found a bug, want a new tool or a feature for your next party? We'd love to hear from you on
      our <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</InfoPage>
